Subject: CPMS I03C Semantic Residual Registry Semantic Refinement

@ [refinement_uuid] 68875153-2767-4199-b169-924ad9e144cd

& [SemanticResidual] is a named condition intentionally not expressible or not discharged by the public JSON Schema document
  + it is neither a vague warning nor an automatic validation failure
  + its record identifies the condition current enforcement evidence and remaining proof burden

& [ResidualIdentity] is an immutable profile-scoped identifier
  + meaning may be superseded only through an explicit relationship
  + identifiers are never recycled after removal or split

& [CoveredRoot] is a public machine-schema root whose reachable type universe can encounter the residual subject
& [ApplicabilityPredicate] is the exact condition under which the residual governs a particular instance or intended use
  + coverage is possibility
  + applicability is obligation

& [SubjectType] is a public or enforcement-relevant named form to which the condition attaches
& [ResidualClass] is capacity semantic_structure integrity lineage authority replay result_shape or non_capability
& [ResidualStage] is a closed observation or enforcement location in the procedure pipeline

& [CodeSnapshot] identifies one whole source file by repository-relative path byte length and SHA256 at the declared baseline
& [CodeBinding] identifies crate module ordered function names and exactly one CodeSnapshot or external dependency identity
  + binding asserts where the condition is presently handled
  + binding does not assert that handling is complete

& [EnforcementDisposition] reports current code status
  + enforced full named condition has exact present rejection or proof behavior
  + partially_enforced exact named subset is present and remaining subset is explicit
  + unimplemented no acceptable enforcement exists
  + observational limitation or non-capability is proved by inspection rather than an acceptance gate
  + outside_i03 enforcement exists in an authority stage I03 cannot invoke

& [I03EvaluationPolicy] limits a future registry consumer
  + safe_pure may call only an already-authorized deterministic pure check
  + observational_only may report evidence and unresolved state without deciding authority
  + prohibited_authority may never invoke or simulate the binding

& [Severity] is advisory sorting metadata from informational release_blocking or authority_blocking
  + severity never overrides evaluation policy or phase lock

& [ProofReference] is a stable repository artifact or named future obligation that can establish one record condition
& [RelatedResidual] is a typed relation depends_on overlaps supersedes split_from or guarded_by
& [Rationale] states why JSON Schema cannot discharge the condition and why the chosen binding is relevant

& [ResidualRegistry] is ordered records plus source snapshots and derived reverse indexes
  + records are authority
  + indexes are acceleration with exact reconstruction proof
  + registry digest is identity

& [RegistryQuery] is pure selection by exact root type stage disposition function proof or residual id
  + query does not execute a binding
  + a returned record is evidence for deliberation and not an authorization token

& [RefinedDisposition] is exact_traceable_semantic_residual_catalogue_contract
